{"seq":3,"slug":"signal-integrity-pcb","title":"信号完整性与电源完整性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"impedance-control","title":"阻抗控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/impedance-control","wordCount":1411,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"high-speed-signal-routing","title":"高速信号走线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/high-speed-signal-routing","wordCount":1430,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-integrity","title":"电源完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/power-integrity","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"信号完整性与电源完整性\">信号完整性与电源完整性</h1><p>当信号频率超过 50 MHz 或上升沿时间低于 1 ns 时，PCB 走线不再是简单导线，而是具有特征阻抗的传输线。信号完整性（SI）和电源完整性（PI）分析成为高速电路设计的必要环节。</p>\n<p>本章聚焦三个关键领域：阻抗控制（传输线模型与匹配终端）、高速信号走线（差分对、串扰抑制、时序约束）、以及电源完整性（PDN 设计、去耦策略、噪声抑制）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节概览\">章节概览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>阻抗控制</td>\n<td>传输线理论</td>\n<td>特征阻抗计算、微带线/带状线、终端匹配方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高速信号走线</td>\n<td>SI 设计</td>\n<td>差分对布线、串扰分析、回流路径、过孔优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电源完整性</td>\n<td>PDN 设计</td>\n<td>去耦网络、目标阻抗、电源平面分割、仿真验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"si-pi-关系\">SI/PI 关系</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[信号完整性 SI] --&gt; B[阻抗匹配]&#10;    A --&gt; C[串扰控制]&#10;    A --&gt; D[时序裕量]&#10;    E[电源完整性 PI] --&gt; F[PDN 阻抗]&#10;    E --&gt; G[去耦设计]&#10;    E --&gt; H[IR Drop]&#10;    A &lt;--&gt;|相互影响| E&#10;    B --&gt; I[眼图质量]&#10;    F --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[信号完整性 SI] --&gt; B[阻抗匹配]\n    A --&gt; C[串扰控制]\n    A --&gt; D[时序裕量]\n    E[电源完整性 PI] --&gt; F[PDN 阻抗]\n    E --&gt; G[去耦设计]\n    E --&gt; H[IR Drop]\n    A &lt;--&gt;|相互影响| E\n    B --&gt; I[眼图质量]\n    F --&gt; I</pre>"}